# Forbidden patterns for the pre-commit hook.
#
# Copy to patterns.local (gitignored) and adapt with your real values.
# One line = one pattern (extended regex, case-insensitive).
# Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Generic examples (replace them with your internal patterns):

# Internal domains of your company
# mycompany\.local
# internal\.example\.com

# Employee / user ID formats
# \b[A-Z][0-9]{6,}\b

# Private IP ranges used internally
# \b10\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\.[0-9]+\b

# Internal hostname prefixes
# \b(prod|staging)-srv[0-9]+\b

# Specific service names
# internal-bastion
